  "question": {
    "text": "A piece of burnt wood of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is found to have a <math><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></msup><mi>C</mi></math> activity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>decay</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> . How long has the tree that this wood belonged to be dead? Given <math><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></msup><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5730</mn></math> year.",
    "image": null
  },
